This repository contains the A11yScope Chrome extension and the a11yscope-mcp
MCP server. The source is published so that the claim "nothing leaves your
machine" can be verified by reading the code rather than taken on trust. It is
not open source.

1. Permitted use

   You may:
   a. read, audit and learn from this source code;
   b. install and run the Chrome extension from the Chrome Web Store and the
      MCP server from npm or from this repository, for any purpose, including
      commercial use, on any number of machines;
   c. run the source locally for your own evaluation and testing;
   d. report problems, including false positives, through the issue tracker.

